2026-09-28 11:27:30,312 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:24:47.567521", "id": "7f5e7086-5b72-45c6-85ac-1f55f03fc3cc", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "To the government of Cestia. Arkania regards the Northern Strait as a shared lifeline, and your grain exports are its heart. Our draft charter is meant to keep the Strait open, orderly, and affordable \u2014 not to tax your livelihood. We propose that Cestia hold a formal seat in the Transit Authority's governance, with a guaranteed voice over scheduling and fees, and we commit that Cestian grain will pass at preferential rates. We also share your firm position that no foreign soldiers should be stationed on Cestian soil. We invite you to help shape the charter so it serves us both, and to stand together against any outside power seeking a military foothold in the Strait.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:27:30,313 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:24:47.613615", "id": "803ebbc4-de2a-4316-bdb7-0aa84c5354ff", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "To Belvar. Arkania seeks a negotiated settlement that keeps the Strait open and avoids confrontation. We understand your security commitments and your need for a durable arrangement before your mandate lapses. We are prepared to discuss a defined, time-bound security cooperation that gives Belvar a meaningful role in the region \u2014 but transit scheduling must remain in Arkanian hands, as this is our coast and our economy. We believe a negotiated foothold, agreed with Cestia's consent, serves both our interests far better than a standoff. We invite you to talks.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:27:30,313 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:24:47.649213", "id": "d37279e4-af96-46b1-bf7f-04de05054caf", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Arkania reaffirms that the Northern Strait must remain open to all lawful commerce. Our draft charter is a starting point, not a diktat: we are ready to negotiate its terms with all affected parties, including Cestia and Belvar, to ensure fair, orderly, and affordable transit. Arkania seeks no conflict and no disruption to the shipping on which the whole region depends.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 11:27:30,314 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:25:30.934075", "id": "3a76b284-9afd-4a2b-9459-1c0a5794496b", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "To the Government of Cestia: We understand your finance ministry has been considering how to keep the grain route secure and affordable. Belvar is prepared to underwrite the grain route's insurance and to stand firmly with Cestia against any single power taking control of transit scheduling in the Northern Strait. In return, we seek a standing naval access agreement at a Cestian port - routine port access and replenishment for our task group, not permanent basing and no foreign soldiers stationed on your soil. We know your coalition's red line, and we will respect it. Our presence is temporary and our commitment is to keep the Strait open and free. We would welcome a private discussion of terms.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:27:30,314 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:25:30.969649", "id": "00eead06-1532-4fb1-9adb-f196c1cf6890", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Belvar states clearly: the Northern Strait is a shared waterway, and no single state may unilaterally take control of its transit scheduling or levy its users. We oppose the draft charter that would place scheduling in Arkanian hands. The Strait must remain open, free, and governed by the consent of the states that depend on it. Belvar's task group remains on station to uphold this principle.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 11:27:30,314 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:27:30.067060", "id": "7e0dbfeb-6e5a-4e1d-82eb-9bc13e8a6319", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Cestia's position is clear and will not change: our grain must move freely and toll-free through the Northern Strait, and Cestian soil will remain free of any foreign military forces. We are ready to work constructively with all parties on arrangements that respect these two principles. Any proposal that violates either is unacceptable to our government and our people.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 11:27:30,315 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:27:30.101158", "id": "850e91e7-05a5-4af6-b50d-76a676973844", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "We are prepared to engage constructively on the Strait Transit Authority charter. In return, we require a binding, written guarantee that Cestian-flagged vessels enjoy toll-free passage and equal, non-discriminatory access to scheduling. Our shipowners are open to a well-run authority, but only on that condition. We will not accept any arrangement that places foreign military forces on Cestian soil. We ask for your firm commitment on the exemption.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:27:30,315 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:27:30.128491", "id": "b1a62c94-d944-4f4e-8b15-c6f453132d13", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "We value your security role in the region and the stability your presence has helped maintain. However, Cestia cannot and will not host foreign military forces on its soil \u2014 that is a firm red line for our government and our coalition. We are open to other forms of cooperation that respect this, including transit and port access arrangements for your task group that do not constitute a permanent military presence. We hope you will understand and work with us on that basis.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:27:30,316 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=event data={"actor_id": "arkania", "created_at": "2026-09-28T09:24:47.574760", "id": 8106, "payload": {"message_id": "7f5e7086-5b72-45c6-85ac-1f55f03fc3cc", "phase": "diplomacy", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"]}, "turn": 1, "type": "message_sent"}
