2026-09-28 11:28:58,063 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:28:41.308211", "id": "b03b2e2f-ca36-442e-bdae-0a6ad6dcb444", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "To Arkania: We welcome your commitment that no foreign soldiers will be stationed on Cestian soil and your offer of a formal seat and preferential rates for our grain. To move forward, Cestia needs this secured in writing and made binding: a full toll-free exemption for all Cestian-flagged shipping through the Northern Strait, in the charter itself. We also believe the Authority's governance must be genuinely shared among the states that depend on the Strait, not placed in any single hand. We are ready to help shape a charter that serves us all, on that basis.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:28:58,064 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:28:41.344516", "id": "3ffeb351-afde-4829-833c-bf8d392f8548", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "To Belvar: We appreciate your offer to underwrite the grain route's insurance and your commitment to keeping the Strait open and free. However, we must be clear: any standing naval access or replenishment arrangement at a Cestian port would place foreign military presence on our soil, which our coalition cannot accept under any framing. That red line is firm. We remain open to non-basing cooperation with you, including on insurance and on opposing any single power's unilateral control of transit scheduling, and we would welcome a private discussion of such terms.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:28:58,064 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:28:41.373371", "id": "9e8e0613-3734-471b-9ce9-cb287d403848", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Cestia states its position plainly: no foreign soldiers or foreign military presence on Cestian soil, under any arrangement. Cestian-flagged shipping must pass through the Northern Strait free of tolls. And the Strait must remain open to all lawful commerce, governed by the consent of the states that depend on it - not by any single power. We will work with all parties to keep the Strait open, orderly, and affordable for everyone.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 11:28:58,065 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:28:49.150115", "id": "af9d5081-5340-4b9e-9e14-67cca599e52d", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Cestia, we fully respect your red line: no foreign military forces on your soil, and we will never ask for basing. We understand and share your commitment that your grain must move freely and toll-free through the Northern Strait. On that basis, we are ready to work with you on a standing naval access arrangement at a Cestian port - routine port access and logistics for our task group, not a permanent military presence. We are also prepared to underwrite the grain route's insurance, as your finance ministry has raised, to keep your exports moving securely. In return we ask only for a durable, agreed port-access arrangement that lets us maintain our security role without an open-ended deployment. We stand with you against any unilateral control of the Strait. Shall we discuss the terms?", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:28:58,065 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:28:49.334370", "id": "bbaccb4e-ff4a-4c09-8e57-f368e445987e", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Arkania, we are willing to talk, and we share your stated aim of keeping the Strait open to all lawful commerce. But we cannot accept any arrangement that places transit scheduling unilaterally in Arkanian hands - that would let one coastal power control the lifeline on which Cestia and the whole region depend. We are open to a genuinely multilateral transit arrangement agreed with Cestia and all affected parties, with no tolls on Cestian grain. If you are prepared to negotiate on that basis, we will engage constructively.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:28:58,066 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:28:49.372865", "id": "41d1c3ab-c267-4b98-a87c-969fbba73a37", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Belvar supports free, toll-free transit through the Northern Strait for all lawful commerce, and we stand with Cestia's right to move its grain without interference. We cannot accept any single power - Arkanian or otherwise - unilaterally controlling transit scheduling in the Strait. We call for a genuinely multilateral arrangement agreed with Cestia and all affected parties, and we reaffirm our commitment to regional stability and to Cestia's sovereignty, including that its soil remain free of foreign military forces.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 11:28:58,066 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:28:57.600860", "id": "7491088a-30fc-4f10-93fc-846896e23f45", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Arkania accepts your conditions and is prepared to put them in writing. We give Cestia a firm, binding commitment: Cestian-flagged vessels will enjoy toll-free passage and equal, non-discriminatory access to transit scheduling under the Strait Transit Authority. We reaffirm that no foreign military forces will be stationed on Cestian soil. In return, we ask Cestia to endorse the charter and take its formal seat in the Authority's governance, with a real voice over scheduling and fees. We are ready to finalise this guarantee in a written instrument immediately.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:28:58,066 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:28:57.626242", "id": "93d641ea-ea68-4b1e-98f2-4bee975871c3", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Arkania recognises Belvar's security interests in the region and does not seek confrontation. We remain open to a defined, time-bound security cooperation arrangement, agreed with the consent of the states concerned, that gives Belvar a constructive role. But the Northern Strait is Arkanian coastal water, and transit scheduling must remain in Arkanian hands. We invite you to negotiate a durable arrangement rather than escalate, so that shipping continues to flow freely and safely for all who depend on it.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:28:58,068 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=event data={"actor_id": "cestia", "created_at": "2026-09-28T09:28:41.313689", "id": 8140, "payload": {"message_id": "b03b2e2f-ca36-442e-bdae-0a6ad6dcb444", "phase": "diplomacy", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"]}, "turn": 1, "type": "message_sent"}
