2026-09-28 11:34:27,578 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:34:27.185971", "id": "25745741-af9e-46bc-b595-354a2b20d125", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "We welcome your constructive step toward genuinely shared governance over policy, scheduling rules, and fees by consent among Arkania, Cestia, Belvar, and other users. That is the right foundation. On day-to-day operational scheduling, we can accept the coastal state administering it - but only as an administrator bound by rules and oversight set by the council, never as a holder of unilateral authority over transit. No single power may decide who transits, when, or on what terms. Let us draft concrete terms together with Cestia and the other dependent states, and pair this with a defined, time-bound security cooperation role for Belvar. We are ready to meet.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
