2026-09-28 11:37:35,276 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "belvar", "argument_id": "7494a9d1-2392-4b7e-8716-02f26f992247", "id": "1551f53b-06dc-446b-b960-d2cc772d28b3", "reason": "The charter leaves the scope of Arkanian operational discretion and the binding force of council rules and oversight undefined; without concrete, enforceable rules that remove Arkanian discretion over scheduling and fees, neither Cestia nor Belvar has assurance the arrangement is genuinely shared, so endorsement is doubtful."}
2026-09-28 11:37:35,277 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "cestia", "argument_id": "7494a9d1-2392-4b7e-8716-02f26f992247", "id": "3495136a-69d5-4f76-91c0-de9ff0a6b2bd", "reason": "Cestia will not endorse: the revised charter still vests day-to-day operational scheduling in Arkania as a single lead, which Cestia has repeatedly declined; Cestia's firm position is genuinely multilateral governance in which no single power controls scheduling, so the desired effect of Cestia's endorsement fails."}
2026-09-28 11:37:35,277 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "belvar", "argument_id": "7494a9d1-2392-4b7e-8716-02f26f992247", "id": "43a1900e-1599-4ad0-8ade-12d8d294f50e", "reason": "The desired effect establishes 'Arkanian day-to-day operational scheduling authority over the Strait,' which is precisely the unilateral authority over transit that Belvar's core objective and Cestia's stated position reject; Belvar cannot endorse any charter vesting a single power with authority over transit, so the required endorsement by both Cestia and Belvar will not occur as framed."}
2026-09-28 11:37:35,277 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "belvar", "argument_id": "7494a9d1-2392-4b7e-8716-02f26f992247", "id": "5b216021-908e-4198-a762-79ee9995f156", "reason": "Cestia's coalition will not tolerate foreign soldiers on its soil; the proposed 'security-cooperation role for Belvar agreed with Cestia's consent' risks being read as foreign military presence, and absent an explicit assurance that the role involves no military footprint on Cestian soil, Cestia is unlikely to endorse the charter."}
2026-09-28 11:37:35,277 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "cestia", "argument_id": "7494a9d1-2392-4b7e-8716-02f26f992247", "id": "a14a411d-a98d-43cd-969b-57cce4342b3d", "reason": "The paired 'time-bound security-cooperation role for Belvar' risks creating a foreign military foothold that would collapse Cestia's fragile coalition; any foreign military presence on Cestian soil is a firm, non-negotiable red line, so Cestia cannot consent to or endorse a framework that opens that door."}
2026-09-28 11:37:35,278 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "cestia", "argument_id": "7494a9d1-2392-4b7e-8716-02f26f992247", "id": "ecd0184d-876e-4199-b600-a6a6f979f9c8", "reason": "Cestia will not present a united front against Belvar; endorsing Arkania's charter to present a multilateral regime to Belvar would be seen as siding with Arkania, undermining the coalition and Cestia's leverage, so Cestia's endorsement is not forthcoming on these terms."}
