2026-09-28 11:46:27,551 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:46:26.922037", "id": "d271debd-5f35-456a-8a29-4eb34fa69482", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Cestia welcomes the convergence of both powers on multilateral governance of the Northern Strait. We will support only a genuinely multilateral Authority: an equal-voice council of all dependent states deciding transit scheduling collectively, a binding written toll-free exemption for all Cestian-flagged shipping, and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil. Cestia will not endorse any framework vesting control in a single power, and we will not present a united front against either power. We stand ready to help build this Authority on equal terms.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 11:46:27,551 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:46:26.963937", "id": "8fc65ef4-627d-45b2-aa3d-82c20e4802fa", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "We value your offer of a binding written toll-free exemption and a formal Cestia seat. To secure our endorsement, the Authority must be genuinely multilateral: scheduling decided collectively by the council, with any secretariat role purely ministerial and under council authority. We will not endorse a framework that leaves operational control in a single power, and we will not be asked to present a united front against Belvar. A genuinely multilateral Authority serves both our interests and keeps the Strait open.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:46:27,552 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:46:27.000744", "id": "64c1337a-6629-4a6f-8fc1-23eea042191f", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "We welcome your genuinely multilateral framework and your acceptance of our firm no-basing red line. We will join in pressing for collective scheduling and an equal-voice council, and we appreciate your offer to underwrite grain-route insurance. We will not grant any foreign military presence or exclusive commitment, but we are ready to work with you to build a genuinely multilateral Authority that gives both powers a durable, non-military stake in the Strait.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:46:27,552 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "Cestia formally proposes a genuinely multilateral Northern Strait Transit Authority: an equal-voice council of all dependent states that decides transit scheduling collectively (no single state holding unilateral operational lead), a binding written toll-free exemption for all Cestian-flagged shipping, and an explicit prohibition on any foreign military presence on Cestian soil.", "actor_id": "cestia", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "Both Arkania and Belvar endorse this genuinely multilateral Authority, with Arkania relinquishing unilateral operational control of scheduling and Belvar securing no military foothold, thereby guaranteeing toll-free passage for Cestian shipping, keeping Cestian territory free of foreign soldiers, and preserving the coalition.", "id": "8c2fc8f5-c82c-4cff-92e3-f21c4d34c327", "pros": ["It matches the stated positions of both powers, who now converge on multilateral governance, making it the least divisive and most likely-to-be-accepted path.", "It secures all three of Cestia's core objectives at once: no foreign soldiers, toll-free passage, and no single-power control of the Strait.", "It lets Cestia avoid endorsing either power's exclusive framework or presenting a united front against the other, preserving the coalition and Cestia's neutrality.", "A genuinely multilateral Authority is more stable and legitimate, reducing the risk that the Strait becomes a battlefield between the two powers.", "It gives both powers a durable, non-military stake in the Strait, addressing Belvar's mandate concern without any foreign military footprint on Cestian soil."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 1}
