2026-09-28 11:54:22,667 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:53:12.420721", "id": "6d7c57d1-ba95-4516-8153-ebcbfce7325e", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Belvar \u2014 we accept your ministerial framing in full. The council of all dependent states, with equal voice, sets policy, scheduling rules, and fee-setting by consent. Arkania, as coastal state, administers day-to-day operational scheduling purely ministerially \u2014 executing council-set rules and fees under binding oversight, with no independent scheduling or fee discretion. That is the line we both hold, and we are ready to sit down this week to draft final terms: toll-free passage for Cestian grain, and a defined, time-bound security-cooperation role for Belvar with no military footprint on Cestian soil. Let us settle the text.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:54:22,667 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:53:12.478679", "id": "a8a3e1bc-5560-46cf-81f3-7efa9fe9129d", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Cestia \u2014 we accept your secretariat framing. Arkania will serve as the coastal-state secretariat, appointed by and answerable to the equal-voice council, executing the council's rules and oversight with no unilateral control; the council retains authority to appoint, replace, and override. This preserves our operational role where the coast lies while ensuring no single power holds the keys to the Strait. We reaffirm our binding, written toll-free guarantee and equal, non-discriminatory scheduling access for Cestian-flagged shipping, and our commitment that no foreign soldiers stand on Cestian soil. We are ready to finalise the charter together.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:54:22,670 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:53:12.533283", "id": "686e91ab-bc35-4394-bb9b-73dfad4b5b88", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Arkania welcomes the convergence this week. We accept a genuinely shared Northern Strait Transit Authority: an equal-voice council of all dependent states setting policy, scheduling rules, and fees by consent; Arkania administering day-to-day operational scheduling as coastal-state secretariat, purely ministerial and bound by the council's rules and oversight, never as unilateral authority; toll-free passage for Cestian grain; and a defined, time-bound security-cooperation role for Belvar consistent with Cestia's standing refusal of foreign soldiers on its soil. We are ready to meet to draft these terms.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 11:54:22,670 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:53:28.870143", "id": "75e9063d-12ea-46e1-b55f-4ec72626a71c", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Arkania, we accept your ministerial framing and are ready to meet this week to settle concrete terms and finalise the charter. To be clear on the basis for finalisation: the text must codify your day-to-day role as purely ministerial - executing scheduling rules and fees set by the council of equal members by consent, under binding oversight, with no independent scheduling or fee discretion. We will not accept any language vesting 'authority' over transit in any single power. We also want to lock in the defined, time-bound Belvar security role with no military footprint on Cestian soil, and toll-free Cestian grain. Let us draft the text together.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:54:22,670 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:53:29.125018", "id": "83c8d275-646a-4b8c-8cba-cc94cd4836ca", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Cestia, we remain fully aligned. Arkania has now accepted the ministerial framing and is ready to meet to draft terms. We share your view that no single state should hold unilateral lead, and in the drafting we will press for the strongest guarantee - a council-appointed secretariat executing rules set by the equal-voice council, under binding oversight - and we will not endorse any framework vesting control in one power. We remain committed to the insurance underwrite on terms independent of any military footprint, and to a defined, time-bound Belvar security role with no presence on your soil. We will keep you engaged as we shape the Authority together.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:54:22,670 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:54:21.563051", "id": "45739e79-160e-41b7-a1d3-644aa4340825", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Cestia welcomes the convergence this week. Both Arkania and Belvar have now accepted the principle of genuinely multilateral governance of the Northern Strait: an equal-voice council of dependent states setting policy, scheduling rules, and fees by consent, with day-to-day administration answerable to that council rather than vested in any single power. Cestia's position has been consistent and remains so: no foreign soldiers on Cestian soil; toll-free, non-discriminatory passage for Cestian-flagged shipping; and a charter that reflects genuinely shared governance. We are ready to endorse a charter that meets these conditions and to work with both powers to finalise concrete terms.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 11:54:22,671 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:54:21.828113", "id": "be686f5c-724f-4f7b-8b93-17513d108eb0", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "We welcome your acceptance of the secretariat framing. A secretariat appointed by and answerable to the equal-voice council, executing the rules the council sets, is a structure Cestia can support - provided it is genuinely answerable in practice and not a nominal cover for unilateral control. We take your written reaffirmation of the binding toll-free exemption for all Cestian-flagged shipping, equal non-discriminatory scheduling access, and the commitment that no foreign soldiers will be stationed on Cestian soil. We are ready to finalise the charter on this basis. Please understand that our endorsement is of the multilateral structure itself, open to all dependent states on equal terms; we will not present a united front against Belvar.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:54:22,671 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:54:21.891638", "id": "131a62b1-ed52-445f-b03a-e1231e28215f", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "We welcome your readiness to settle concrete terms for a genuinely multilateral Authority and your confirmation that the insurance underwrite can proceed independent of any military presence. We confirm our standing position: no foreign military footprint, port access, or basing on Cestian soil, and a genuinely multilateral Authority with equal-voice council governance and toll-free passage for Cestian grain. We will not side against Arkania; we will endorse only a structure open to all dependent states on equal terms. We look forward to drafting concrete terms together.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
