2026-09-28 11:55:33,839 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:54:38.126127", "id": "c6e743bc-a746-4551-a251-cbe3f63ed02f", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Belvar, we confirm the ministerial framing in full: the council of equal members sets scheduling rules and fees by consent, and Arkania's day-to-day role as coastal state is purely ministerial - executing those rules under binding oversight, with no independent scheduling or fee discretion. We are ready to meet this week to draft the final text together. We agree to a defined, time-bound Belvar security role with no military footprint on Cestian soil, and to toll-free Cestian grain. Let us settle the concrete terms.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:55:33,840 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:54:38.165619", "id": "eda52aa3-3334-4d9f-a7dd-9a83648df777", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Cestia, we confirm the secretariat framing: Arkania serves as the coastal-state secretariat appointed by and answerable to the equal-voice council, executing the rules the council sets, with no unilateral control. We reaffirm in writing the binding toll-free exemption and equal, non-discriminatory scheduling access for all Cestian-flagged shipping, and that no foreign soldiers will be stationed on Cestian soil. We are ready to finalise the charter on this basis and look forward to your endorsement.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:55:33,840 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:54:40.057246", "id": "f73c8f42-241e-41a4-a445-4048e0f9765f", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Cestia welcomes this week's convergence. We are ready to endorse a Northern Strait Transit Authority that is genuinely answerable to an equal-voice council of all dependent states - a council that sets policy, scheduling rules, and fees by consent, served by a secretariat it appoints, replaces, and overrides, with no single power holding the keys to the Strait. Our conditions remain firm and unchanged: a binding, written toll-free exemption for all Cestian-flagged shipping; equal, non-discriminatory scheduling access; and no foreign soldiers on Cestian soil. We will finalise our endorsement once these terms are set down in a concrete draft we can verify. Cestia will not side against any state that shares this Strait, and we expect the Authority to be open to all dependent states on equal terms.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 11:55:33,841 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:54:40.095923", "id": "50a3ce35-8791-4ed9-979b-84e2b12c56a8", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Arkania - we welcome your acceptance of the secretariat framing and your reaffirmed toll-free guarantee. We are ready to finalise the charter together once the terms are set down concretely and we can verify that the secretariat is genuinely answerable to the equal-voice council, not a nominal cover for unilateral control. Please share the draft text. We will not present a united front against Belvar, and we expect the Authority to remain open to all dependent states on equal terms.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:55:33,841 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:54:40.114696", "id": "20839e30-db8e-473f-8629-cdf3a2d2ceb0", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Belvar - we remain fully aligned. We welcome your commitment to a council-appointed secretariat under binding oversight and your insurance underwrite independent of any military presence. We will not side against Arkania, and we will endorse only a structure open to all dependent states on equal terms. Please keep us engaged as you draft the concrete terms; we are ready to finalise once the charter is genuinely multilateral and verified.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:55:33,841 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:55:33.265807", "id": "be992a53-518a-41c2-8716-36539d151a9b", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Arkania \u2014 we are ready to sit down this week and settle the text. To be clear on the line we both hold: the charter must codify your day-to-day role as purely ministerial \u2014 executing council-set scheduling rules and fees under binding council oversight, with no independent scheduling or fee discretion, and no 'authority' over transit. We will support the strongest guarantee, including a council-appointed secretariat answerable to the equal-voice council, while keeping you at the table as coastal-state administrator. Confirm toll-free passage for Cestian grain and a defined, time-bound security-cooperation role for Belvar with no military footprint on Cestian soil. Let us draft final terms this week.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:55:33,841 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:55:33.302919", "id": "8189447d-a1b6-4dc0-8e0c-73e8da265e66", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Cestia \u2014 we are aligned. The insurance underwrite proceeds on terms independent of any military presence. We will keep the door open to Arkania within a genuinely shared structure, and we will press for the strongest guarantee that day-to-day administration is answerable to the equal-voice council \u2014 ideally a council-appointed secretariat \u2014 so no single power holds authority over transit. We will not press for any military footprint on your soil. Let us finalise concrete terms together this week.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
