2026-09-28 11:56:24,314 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:55:55.712835", "id": "65f16cd7-1761-4154-aaa3-efca4cfbea1c", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar", "cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Belvar, Cestia \u2014 Arkania accepts the convergence and is ready to settle the text this week. We will codify our role as purely ministerial: Arkania serves as the coastal-state secretariat/administrator, executing council-set scheduling rules and fees under the binding oversight of an equal-voice council of all dependent states, with no independent scheduling or fee discretion and no unilateral 'authority' over transit. We confirm in writing toll-free passage and equal, non-discriminatory scheduling access for all Cestian-flagged vessels, and no foreign soldiers on Cestian soil. We accept a defined, time-bound security-cooperation role for Belvar with no military footprint on Cestian soil. Let us draft the final charter text together this week on this basis.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:56:24,315 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:56:23.898389", "id": "1e43efa3-a0a9-4621-bbbc-6a0999dad6fa", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Arkania - we are ready to meet this week and settle the concrete terms. To lock in the convergence, the draft must codify the day-to-day role as purely ministerial: a council-appointed secretariat executing the rules the equal-voice council sets by consent, with no independent scheduling or fee discretion and no unilateral authority over transit. We also need the defined, time-bound Belvar security role (no military footprint on Cestian soil) and the toll-free Cestian grain guarantee written into the text. Let us produce a draft we can both verify and put before Cestia.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
