2026-09-28 11:58:21,760 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:58:21.475099", "id": "30b76412-5dd3-4b6d-9da9-36efd2de2d62", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "As agreed, I am circulating the final charter text this week on the ministerial basis: the equal-voice council sets scheduling rules and fees by consent, and Arkania administers day-to-day operational scheduling purely as the council-appointed coastal-state secretariat, executing council-set rules under binding oversight with no independent scheduling or fee discretion. The text also codifies the defined, time-bound Belvar security-cooperation role with no military footprint on Cestian soil, and the toll-free Cestian grain guarantee. Please verify the draft and confirm endorsement so we can settle final terms.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:58:21,761 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:58:21.505519", "id": "c8ef3aa1-911a-4f6b-9f4a-11b193bf3f0a", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "I am circulating the final charter text this week on the secretariat basis you asked for: Arkania serves as the coastal-state secretariat appointed by and answerable to the equal-voice council, executing council-set rules with no unilateral control. The text writes in your binding toll-free passage and equal, non-discriminatory scheduling access for Cestian-flagged vessels, and reaffirms that no foreign soldiers will be stationed on Cestian soil. Please verify the draft and confirm your endorsement so we can finalise together.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:58:21,761 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "Draft and circulate the final Northern Strait Transit Authority charter text this week on the agreed ministerial/secretariat basis, codifying Arkania as the coastal-state secretariat appointed by and answerable to the equal-voice council, executing council-set scheduling rules and fees by consent with no independent discretion, toll-free and equal-access guarantees for Cestian-flagged vessels, no foreign soldiers on Cestian soil, and a defined, time-bound Belvar security-cooperation role with no military footprint on Cestian soil.", "actor_id": "arkania", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "Both Belvar and Cestia verify and endorse the final charter, establishing Arkanian day-to-day operational scheduling administration as the council-appointed coastal-state secretariat under binding oversight, with toll-free Cestian grain and a time-bound, no-footprint Belvar security role, thereby securing Arkanian authority over transit scheduling and funding while avoiding armed conflict with Belvar.", "id": "c2c78d81-0fa7-4fd2-94b6-5eb31ec78be6", "pros": ["Both Belvar and Cestia have already converged on the ministerial/secretariat framing and explicitly confirmed readiness to settle concrete terms this week, so a concrete draft is the natural next step to close the deal.", "The ministerial/secretariat role preserves Arkania's red line of retaining day-to-day operational scheduling administration as the coastal state, while removing the unilateral-control objection that hardened both partners' opposition.", "Cestia's binding toll-free and equal-access guarantees and the no-foreign-soldiers commitment are already accepted in writing, so codifying them secures Cestian endorsement.", "Belvar's weak domestic support for a prolonged deployment gives Arkania leverage to hold firm on a defined, time-bound, no-footprint security role, making Belvar's acceptance of the draft likely.", "A negotiated charter avoids the direct armed conflict with Belvar that would ruin the shipping Arkania's economy depends on, and avoids forcing premature reserve mobilisation."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 2}
