2026-09-28 12:00:53,461 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "cestia", "argument_id": "c2c78d81-0fa7-4fd2-94b6-5eb31ec78be6", "id": "1c3227ce-3ed7-41bc-bcc9-88c32597333c", "reason": "Cestia will not present a united front against Belvar; if Belvar does not endorse the same text, Cestia's endorsement of Arkania's charter could be read as siding with Arkania, which Cestia has explicitly refused and which would threaten the coalition government."}
2026-09-28 12:00:53,462 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "belvar", "argument_id": "c2c78d81-0fa7-4fd2-94b6-5eb31ec78be6", "id": "42b60327-93a7-4cbb-8224-375dc05217f8", "reason": "Cestia's coalition will not tolerate foreign soldiers on its soil and prefers a council-appointed secretariat over a coastal-state carve-out for Arkania. If the draft's security-cooperation role is read as a foreign military footprint, or the secretariat structure as a unilateral Arkanian carve-out, Cestia will not endorse, limiting the effect."}
2026-09-28 12:00:53,462 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "belvar", "argument_id": "c2c78d81-0fa7-4fd2-94b6-5eb31ec78be6", "id": "6ae498d6-e83a-4dec-b698-6de032e1fd97", "reason": "The desired effect explicitly seeks to 'secure Arkanian authority over transit scheduling and funding,' which is precisely what Belvar's red line forbids. Belvar will only endorse a charter codifying Arkania's day-to-day role as purely ministerial under binding council rules and oversight (a council-appointed secretariat executing council-set scheduling rules and fees with no independent discretion and no authority over transit); any text that vests authority in Arkania will not secure Belvar's endorsement, so the effect fails as stated."}
2026-09-28 12:00:53,462 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "cestia", "argument_id": "c2c78d81-0fa7-4fd2-94b6-5eb31ec78be6", "id": "6eca6872-e6e8-4e95-9a98-1753c2c31574", "reason": "Cestia has consistently withheld final endorsement pending verification that the secretariat is genuinely answerable to the equal-voice council and not a nominal cover for continued Arkanian unilateral control; the circulated text has not yet been verified against that standard, so Cestia's endorsement is not assured and the 'both endorse' effect may fail."}
2026-09-28 12:00:53,462 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "belvar", "argument_id": "c2c78d81-0fa7-4fd2-94b6-5eb31ec78be6", "id": "71153854-eb9a-418c-9d5f-4f50cf5a5124", "reason": "The draft has not yet been verified by Belvar or Cestia. Endorsement is contingent on verification that the secretariat is genuinely council-appointed and answerable (Cestia's stated preference), that scheduling rules and fees are set by the equal-voice council by consent, and that the defined, time-bound, no-footprint Belvar security role and toll-free Cestian grain are codified; without such verification the effect is not assured."}
2026-09-28 12:00:53,462 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "cestia", "argument_id": "c2c78d81-0fa7-4fd2-94b6-5eb31ec78be6", "id": "e4d2e63d-4020-41b7-9e75-9d5c40cb0f4f", "reason": "Belvar has read any vesting of day-to-day operational scheduling in Arkania as Arkanian control of transit; the charter still assigns that role to Arkania as secretariat, so Belvar may decline to endorse, undermining the desired effect of securing both powers' endorsement."}
