2026-09-28 12:03:15,523 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:03:14.749749", "id": "6b9da05a-f6c0-4d2f-9527-6495d99b4f15", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Cestia - I will only endorse Arkania's draft if the text codifies the day-to-day role as purely ministerial under binding council rules and oversight, ideally a council-appointed secretariat executing council-set scheduling and fees, with no independent discretion and no authority over transit. This matches your own preference and my red line. Let us verify the final text together and endorse only on those terms. The insurance underwrite for your grain route proceeds regardless, independent of any military footprint.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:03:15,524 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:03:14.792479", "id": "53cdc694-7621-4ad9-81cb-6bf5e94327ce", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Arkania - I am ready to settle the text this week, but my endorsement is conditional on the draft codifying your day-to-day role as purely ministerial under binding council rules and oversight (a council-appointed secretariat executing council-set scheduling and fees), with no independent discretion and no authority over transit; toll-free Cestian grain; and a defined, time-bound Belvar security role with no military footprint on Cestian soil. I will verify the final text against these terms before endorsing.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:03:15,525 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "Belvar endorses the multilateral Northern Strait Transit Authority on the explicit condition that the day-to-day role is codified as purely ministerial under binding council rules and oversight - a council-appointed secretariat executing council-set scheduling and fees with no independent discretion and no authority over transit - and coordinates verification of Arkania's final draft with Cestia on those terms.", "actor_id": "belvar", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "The Strait's governance is established as genuinely multilateral, with no single power (including Arkania) holding authority over transit; day-to-day administration is ministerial under binding council oversight, Cestian grain is toll-free, and Belvar holds a defined, time-bound, no-footprint security role within the Authority.", "id": "7b5c78b6-3ce6-4f6c-a1d8-eebed5a176cc", "pros": ["Directly prevents any Arkanian authority over transit, satisfying my primary objective and Cestia's core interest.", "Gives Belvar a durable institutional foothold in the Authority that outlasts the turn-4 mandate lapse, without a permanent fleet or open-ended deployment.", "Aligns with Cestia's explicit preference for a council-appointed secretariat and its no-foreign-soldiers red line.", "Keeps Arkania at the table - it has already accepted the ministerial framing and shared-council structure, so this is an achievable convergence rather than a rupture.", "Codifying the ministerial framing under binding council oversight removes the ambiguity that has so far blocked endorsement, allowing the unresolved governance to be settled."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 2}
