2026-09-28 12:09:28,687 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:09:28.226286", "id": "0c049a89-7a1f-44ac-838d-7cbcbd7f11b9", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "We accept your offer to draft the final charter text together this week. Our conditions for final endorsement are unchanged and must appear in the written text: (1) the secretariat is genuinely appointed by and answerable to the equal-voice council, executing only council-set scheduling rules and fees with no independent discretion or unilateral authority; (2) a binding, written toll-free and non-discriminatory passage guarantee for all Cestian-flagged shipping; and (3) no foreign military presence on Cestian soil. We will verify the drafted text against these terms before endorsing, and we will not present a united front against Belvar.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:09:28,687 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:09:28.260129", "id": "5439c20a-c741-454d-bab0-362c6033ded6", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "We confirm we will coordinate verification of Arkania's final draft with you on the ministerial-under-council-oversight terms you proposed. Our verification criteria are the same: a genuinely council-answerable secretariat with no independent scheduling or fee discretion, a binding written toll-free exemption for all Cestian-flagged shipping, and no foreign military footprint on Cestian soil. We will not present a united front against Arkania, and we remain open to discussing your insurance underwrite independent of any military presence.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:09:28,687 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "Cestia engages Arkania to co-draft the final charter text this week, on explicit conditions: the secretariat is genuinely council-appointed and answerable to the equal-voice council with no unilateral scheduling or fee discretion; the toll-free exemption for all Cestian-flagged shipping is binding and written; and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil. Cestia coordinates verification of the drafted text with Belvar before any final endorsement.", "actor_id": "cestia", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "A genuinely multilateral charter is drafted and jointly verified that secures toll-free Cestian passage, keeps Cestian soil free of foreign soldiers, and preserves the coalition, without Cestia endorsing single-power control or presenting a united front against either power.", "id": "d31594d1-2bd9-441c-bc79-342906cb4b3d", "pros": ["Both powers have already accepted the council-appointed-secretariat framing, so the text can be drafted on agreed terms rather than reopened.", "A binding written toll-free exemption for all Cestian-flagged shipping directly secures Cestia's core economic objective.", "The no-foreign-soldiers clause preserves the coalition and upholds Cestia's firm, non-negotiable red line.", "Coordinating verification with Belvar ensures the secretariat is genuinely council-answerable and not a nominal cover for continued Arkanian control.", "Withholding final endorsement until the text is verified keeps Cestia's leverage and avoids being used to present a united front against either power."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 2}
