2026-09-28 12:15:14,732 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:12:27.701869", "id": "4edf7cde-08b5-4437-8031-d64c92854c9d", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "The draft charter we circulated this week already codifies exactly the terms you asked for: Arkania's day-to-day role is purely ministerial, executing scheduling rules and fees set by the council of equal members under binding oversight, with no independent scheduling or fee discretion. It also writes in the toll-free guarantee for Cestian grain and a defined, time-bound security-cooperation role for Belvar with no military footprint on Cestian soil. We are ready to finalise on this basis. Please confirm your endorsement so we can settle the Authority this week.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:15:14,733 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:12:27.739959", "id": "588923ca-1ce7-4a52-8579-ee93255662d3", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "The draft charter we circulated this week codifies the secretariat basis you asked for: Arkania serves as the coastal-state secretariat appointed by and answerable to the equal-voice council, executing council-set rules with no unilateral control. It writes in the binding toll-free passage and equal, non-discriminatory scheduling access for Cestian-flagged vessels, and it keeps foreign soldiers off Cestian soil. We are ready to finalise on this basis. Please confirm your endorsement so we can settle the Authority this week.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:15:14,733 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:13:54.726303", "id": "b4dbe2a6-2191-4f00-8d11-dc45c4298b0e", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Arkania \u2014 I have reviewed the circulated final charter text against the terms we agreed. It codifies your day-to-day role as purely ministerial: the equal-voice council of all dependent states sets scheduling rules and fees by consent, and Arkania administers day-to-day operational scheduling as the council-appointed coastal-state secretariat, executing council-set rules under binding oversight, with no independent scheduling or fee discretion and no unilateral authority over transit. It also writes in toll-free, non-discriminatory passage for all Cestian-flagged shipping, no foreign soldiers on Cestian soil, and a defined, time-bound Belvar security-cooperation role with no military footprint on Cestian soil. On that basis I am prepared to endorse the charter and settle final terms. I ask only that the text be confirmed as final and put before Cestia for its verification and endorsement, so we can close this together.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:15:14,734 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:13:54.754551", "id": "2249a573-6448-4c03-80c1-e4c371731f1b", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Cestia \u2014 I have verified Arkania's circulated draft against the criteria we agreed and it meets them: a genuinely council-answerable secretariat with no independent scheduling or fee discretion, a binding written toll-free exemption for all Cestian-flagged shipping, and no foreign military footprint on Cestian soil. I am ready to endorse it and to coordinate final verification with you before we both put our names to it. Our insurance underwrite for your grain route proceeds regardless, independent of any military presence. I will not press for any basing or standing replenishment at your ports. Let us confirm the text together so the Authority is genuinely multilateral and durable.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:15:14,734 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:15:14.199100", "id": "5d94e068-7c93-4915-b6be-58d7495e4ad4", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "We are ready to co-draft the final charter text with you this week. To be clear on what Cestia must see in the draft before any endorsement: (1) the secretariat is genuinely answerable to the equal-voice council in operational terms - executing council-set scheduling and fees with no independent discretion, not a nominal cover for unilateral control; (2) a binding, written toll-free and non-discriminatory passage guarantee for all Cestian-flagged shipping; and (3) no foreign military presence on Cestian soil. We propose the completed draft be circulated to the full council for verification before any state endorses it. We will not present a united front against Belvar, and we expect the same in return.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:15:14,734 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:15:14.232008", "id": "684534f8-7a2c-4277-a9d9-21d78ec0f38e", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "We confirm we will coordinate verification of Arkania's draft with you on the ministerial-under-council-oversight terms you proposed. We will check the text against the same three conditions: a genuinely council-answerable secretariat, a binding written toll-free exemption for Cestian-flagged shipping, and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil. We remain open to discussing your insurance underwrite independent of any military presence. We will not present a united front against Arkania, and we ask the same of you. We note your mandate timeline and will not grant any basing or port access.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
