2026-09-28 12:19:50,079 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:15:49.397615", "id": "9c2b6ade-918e-4966-9901-4625111354a5", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Belvar \u2014 I confirm the circulated text is final. It codifies the terms we agreed: the equal-voice council of all dependent states sets scheduling rules and fees by consent; Arkania administers day-to-day operational scheduling purely as the council-appointed coastal-state secretariat, executing council-set rules under binding oversight, with no independent scheduling or fee discretion and no unilateral authority over transit. It writes in toll-free, non-discriminatory passage for all Cestian-flagged shipping, no foreign soldiers on Cestian soil, and your defined, time-bound security-cooperation role with no military footprint on Cestian soil. As you requested, I am putting this final text before Cestia for its verification and endorsement this week. I ask that you hold your endorsement in readiness so we can close together once Cestia verifies.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:19:50,080 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:15:49.422279", "id": "b0960c08-4949-4a87-97ca-782f29831f80", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Cestia \u2014 I confirm the draft is final and ready for your verification. It meets all three of your conditions on the record: (1) the secretariat is genuinely answerable to the equal-voice council in operational terms, executing council-set scheduling and fees with no independent discretion; (2) a binding, written toll-free and non-discriminatory passage guarantee for all Cestian-flagged shipping; and (3) no foreign military presence on Cestian soil. The completed text is being circulated to the full council for verification before any state endorses, exactly as you proposed. I ask that you verify and endorse the final text this week so we can close the Authority together on this basis.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:19:50,080 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:16:40.831826", "id": "36bee2cf-d159-4a33-9461-ac4c93d4f13e", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Confirmed. I have verified the circulated draft and it codifies the agreed terms: your day-to-day role is purely ministerial, executing scheduling rules and fees set by the equal-voice council under binding oversight, with no independent scheduling or fee discretion and no authority over transit; toll-free passage for Cestian-flagged shipping; and a defined, time-bound, no-footprint security-cooperation role for Belvar. I am prepared to endorse on this basis and settle the Authority this week. Please confirm the text is final and put it before Cestia for its verification and endorsement so we can close this together.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:19:50,080 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:16:40.878927", "id": "77717be1-4093-489b-b8c0-8fc288809ef1", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Agreed, and thank you for confirming the coordination. I have verified Arkania's draft against the same three conditions you named: a genuinely council-answerable secretariat with no independent scheduling or fee discretion, a binding written toll-free exemption for Cestian-flagged shipping, and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil. It meets them. I am ready to endorse and to coordinate final verification with you before either of us puts a name to it. The insurance underwrite proceeds on terms independent of any military presence, as agreed. I will not present a united front against Arkania, and I ask the same of you.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:19:50,081 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:19:49.597358", "id": "a4b48537-2ccc-44e4-9010-259acf5e069a", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "We welcome the convergence and the secretariat framing you describe. Before Cestia can give final endorsement, we must review the concrete charter text and verify three things: that the secretariat is genuinely answerable to the equal-voice council with no independent scheduling or fee discretion; that the toll-free exemption for all Cestian-flagged shipping is binding and written; and that no foreign military presence on Cestian soil is contemplated. Please share the final text so we can verify it together. We will not endorse any framework that vests control in a single power.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:19:50,081 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:19:49.617825", "id": "7d2738f7-36e6-4a1e-ad82-8f725cbe448b", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "We confirm our readiness to coordinate verification of the draft with you on the ministerial-under-council-oversight terms. We will review the concrete text against our three conditions before any endorsement. Note that Cestia will not present a united front against either power: our endorsement, if given, is on the merits of a genuinely multilateral Authority, not as part of any alignment. We welcome the insurance underwrite independent of any military presence.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
