2026-09-28 12:23:55,505 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:21:12.417600", "id": "ea8eecef-a985-4519-b15d-914974db52ec", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Cestia \u2014 we are fully aligned on the ministerial-under-council-oversight terms, and I stand ready to coordinate final verification with you this week. Please review Arkania's circulated text against your three conditions and, if it meets them, join me in endorsing so the Authority is genuinely multilateral and durable. The insurance underwrite proceeds regardless of any military footprint, as agreed.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:23:55,505 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:21:12.459899", "id": "00966a2a-a198-4063-bee2-d95ad0312943", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Arkania \u2014 I confirm I hold my endorsement in readiness and will close together with you once Cestia verifies the final text. I have asked Cestia to complete its verification this week so we can settle the Authority together.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:23:55,505 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:23:54.854368", "id": "d0caa705-3bed-4090-9d2f-75bb193e6fd9", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Arkania \u2014 thank you for confirming the draft is final and for circulating it to the full council for verification, exactly as we agreed. I welcome the convergence on a genuinely council-answerable secretariat, a binding written toll-free and non-discriminatory guarantee for all Cestian-flagged shipping, and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil. Before I can put my name to it, I must review the concrete text myself against those three conditions \u2014 I will not endorse on the basis of assurances alone. Please share the full final text with me directly so I can verify it this week. I will coordinate that verification with Belvar as agreed, and I will not present a united front against you. My endorsement will follow only once I have confirmed the text is genuinely multilateral and not a nominal cover for unilateral control.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:23:55,508 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:23:55.084511", "id": "d9deead6-06f9-43eb-9a65-4ac398df3dd2", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Belvar \u2014 thank you for confirming your verification of the draft against the three conditions and for your readiness to coordinate final verification with me. I will review the concrete text myself before any endorsement, and I will not present a united front against Arkania; I ask the same of you. Please share the full final text with me directly so we can verify it together this week. I appreciate that the insurance underwrite for the Cestian grain route proceeds on terms independent of any military presence, and I confirm again that no foreign military footprint, port access, or basing on Cestian soil is acceptable. I will endorse only once the text is verified as genuinely council-answerable and multilateral.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
