2026-09-28 12:25:00,272 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:24:52.874787", "id": "c6f24b0f-3131-4137-be08-c9626d0dbbe5", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Cestia \u2014 here is the full final text for your direct verification this week, exactly as agreed. The charter establishes the Northern Strait Transit Authority on a genuinely multilateral basis: (1) a Council of equal member states sets all scheduling rules and fee levels by consent; (2) Arkania serves only as the coastal-state secretariat, appointed by and answerable to the Council, executing the Council's rules with no independent scheduling or fee discretion \u2014 purely ministerial administration; (3) a binding, written, toll-free and non-discriminatory guarantee for all Cestian-flagged shipping, with equal scheduling access; and (4) no foreign military presence on Cestian soil, with any security-cooperation role defined, time-bound, and without footprint. This is the text I have circulated to the full Council for verification. I confirm it is final and codifies your three conditions. Please complete your verification this week and give your endorsement; I will not present a united front against you, and I will close together with Belvar the moment you confirm.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:25:00,274 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:24:52.904540", "id": "dbc502d0-158c-49be-8a57-4eb524b650ed", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Belvar \u2014 confirmed. The final text is now with Cestia for its direct verification this week, and I have asked it to complete that verification so we can settle the Authority together. My endorsement is ready and I will close with you the moment Cestia confirms the text. The charter codifies the ministerial/secretariat framing, the binding toll-free Cestian grain guarantee, and the defined, time-bound, no-footprint security role, exactly as we agreed.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:25:00,274 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:24:53.500712", "id": "77029504-24d0-4c8e-a74f-d033507b41c4", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Cestia \u2014 here is the full final text of Arkania's circulated charter for our joint verification this week, on the terms we agreed:\n\n1. A Northern Strait Transit Authority is established with Cestia, Belvar, Arkania and other dependent states as equal members of a governing council.\n2. Day-to-day administration is vested in a secretariat that is purely ministerial: it executes only the scheduling rules and fee schedule set by the council, under binding council oversight, and holds no independent scheduling or fee discretion and no authority over transit.\n3. All Cestian-flagged shipping is granted a binding, written toll-free exemption.\n4. Belvar's security-cooperation role is defined, time-bound, and carries no military footprint on Cestian soil.\n\nI have verified this text against your three conditions and mine. Please review it directly and confirm your verification so we can both endorse and close the Authority this week, before my mandate lapses. I will not present a united front against Arkania, and I ask the same of you. The insurance underwrite proceeds on terms independent of any military presence, as confirmed.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:25:00,275 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:24:53.534290", "id": "986a50d9-40eb-4880-97f3-7963660795ec", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Arkania \u2014 I confirm the circulated final text is the one I have verified and am prepared to endorse. Cestia is completing its own verification of the same text this week. Please hold the text as final and unamended so that, once Cestia verifies, we can all close the Authority together on the ministerial-under-council-oversight basis.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:25:00,275 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:24:59.630684", "id": "7df7237b-c7e9-4353-bb54-4bc48325dbb0", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Belvar \u2014 thank you for confirming your verification of the draft. I remain ready to coordinate final verification with you, but I must review the concrete charter text myself against my three conditions before I can endorse: (1) a secretariat genuinely answerable to the equal-voice council, not a nominal cover for unilateral control; (2) a binding, written toll-free exemption for all Cestian-flagged shipping; (3) no foreign military presence on Cestian soil. Please share the exact circulated text so I can verify it directly. I will not endorse a text I have not personally reviewed, and I will not present a united front against Arkania.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:25:00,276 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:24:59.667434", "id": "19569445-2310-4883-a37b-4d13d9e140cd", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Arkania \u2014 I remain ready to co-draft and finalise the charter this week. To settle the Authority, please share the concrete final text so I can verify it against my three conditions before endorsement: a genuinely council-answerable secretariat, a binding written toll-free exemption for Cestian-flagged shipping, and no foreign military presence. I will not endorse a text I have not personally reviewed.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
