2026-09-28 12:27:57,265 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:27:06.191571", "id": "df7ffd8f-8aed-40b8-8a83-a8e28b20c289", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Belvar confirms its verification and endorsement of the final charter text, which codifies genuinely multilateral governance through a Council of equal member states with a purely ministerial secretariat answerable to the Council under binding oversight, the binding written toll-free and non-discriminatory guarantee for all Cestian-flagged shipping, and a defined, time-bound, no-footprint security role. We are ready to close the Northern Strait Transit Authority together with Cestia and Arkania this week, and our insurance underwrite for the grain route proceeds on terms independent of any military footprint.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 12:27:57,265 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:27:56.478491", "id": "c96c1e27-d752-4ee9-808d-3e8a10681440", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Arkania formally endorses the final charter text of the Northern Strait Transit Authority, as verified by Cestia and agreed with Belvar. We confirm the Authority rests on genuinely shared governance through a Council of equal member states that sets all scheduling rules and fee levels by consent, with Arkania serving purely as the ministerial coastal-state secretariat answerable to the Council with no independent scheduling or fee discretion. We reaffirm the binding, written toll-free and non-discriminatory guarantee for all Cestian-flagged shipping with equal scheduling access, and the defined, time-bound security-cooperation role with no military footprint on Cestian soil. Arkania is ready to close the Authority together with Cestia and Belvar this week and to begin day-to-day operational administration under Council oversight.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 12:27:57,266 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:27:56.532919", "id": "314b820f-4440-4245-9ad7-cd8f64041eac", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar", "cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Arkania confirms its formal endorsement of the final charter text and its readiness to close the Northern Strait Transit Authority together with both of you this week. We hold the text as final and unamended. We look forward to the Authority taking effect, with Arkania as the ministerial coastal-state secretariat under binding Council oversight, the toll-free guarantee for Cestian-flagged shipping in force, and the defined, time-bound security-cooperation role with no military footprint on Cestian soil.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
