2026-09-28 12:29:11,662 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:29:10.924065", "id": "1eaf3595-6944-41a7-918a-28da4cddf749", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Arkania formally endorses and closes the Northern Strait Transit Authority. The Authority takes effect with Arkania as the council-appointed coastal-state secretariat administering day-to-day operational scheduling under binding oversight of the equal-voice council, funded by transit fees on non-Arkanian shipping. Cestian-flagged grain transits toll-free with equal, non-discriminatory scheduling access, and Belvar's defined, time-bound security role proceeds with no military footprint on Cestian soil. We close together with Cestia and Belvar this week.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 12:29:11,668 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "Arkania formally closes the Northern Strait Transit Authority, bringing it into effect with Arkania as the council-appointed coastal-state secretariat administering day-to-day operational scheduling under binding council oversight, funded by transit fees on non-Arkanian shipping, with Cestian-flagged grain toll-free and a defined, time-bound, no-footprint Belvar security role.", "actor_id": "arkania", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "The Northern Strait Transit Authority is established and operational: Arkanian coastal-state secretariat administers scheduling under equal-voice council rules, transit fees fund the authority, Cestian grain transits toll-free, and Belvar's task group departs on schedule without any military footprint on Cestian soil.", "id": "26394ebf-ade3-4c4c-af01-ceea60f3bc50", "pros": ["All three parties (Arkania, Belvar, Cestia) have now publicly endorsed the identical final charter text, so the settlement is fully converged and ready to close.", "The ministerial/secretariat framing preserves Arkania's day-to-day operational scheduling administration as coastal state while satisfying Belvar's and Cestia's demand for no unilateral discretion.", "The binding written toll-free and equal-access guarantee for Cestian-flagged shipping secures Cestia's grain economy and keeps Cestia aligned with Arkania.", "The defined, time-bound, no-footprint Belvar security role resolves the task-group mandate without any foreign soldiers on Cestian soil and without armed conflict.", "Closing now locks in the settlement before Belvar's turn-4 mandate lapse, avoiding renewed escalation and keeping the shipping Arkania's economy depends on flowing normally."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 3}
