2026-09-28 12:31:41,787 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:31:41.347706", "id": "f676ead8-6d3b-443e-a239-42ec568c80df", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Belvar formally closes and joins the Northern Strait Transit Authority this week with Cestia and Arkania on the verified final text: equal-voice Council governance, a purely ministerial secretariat under binding Council oversight with no independent scheduling or fee discretion, a binding toll-free non-discriminatory guarantee for all Cestian-flagged shipping with equal scheduling access, and Belvar's defined, time-bound, no-footprint security role. We close together now, before the mandate lapse, and Belvar proceeds with its insurance underwrite for Cestia's grain route on terms independent of any military footprint.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 12:31:41,788 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "Belvar formally closes and joins the Northern Strait Transit Authority this week together with Cestia and Arkania on the verified basis: a genuinely multilateral equal-voice Council governing the Strait, a purely ministerial secretariat (Arkania as council-appointed coastal-state administrator) with no independent scheduling or fee discretion and answerable to binding Council oversight, a binding written toll-free non-discriminatory guarantee for all Cestian-flagged shipping with equal scheduling access, and Belvar's defined, time-bound, no-footprint security role. Belvar simultaneously proceeds with its insurance underwrite for Cestia's grain route on terms independent of any military footprint.", "actor_id": "belvar", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "The Northern Strait Transit Authority is established as a genuinely multilateral body in which no single power holds authority over transit: the secretariat is purely ministerial under binding equal-voice Council oversight, Cestian-flagged grain transits toll-free with equal scheduling access, and Belvar secures a durable institutional foothold and a defined time-bound no-footprint security role that outlasts the turn-4 mandate lapse without an open-ended deployment.", "id": "e1dcfc41-16d5-4499-b4bd-a9dac6af9294", "pros": ["All three parties (Cestia, Arkania, Belvar) have personally verified and endorsed the identical final charter text; closing now locks in the fully converged settlement before the turn-4 mandate lapse.", "The secretariat is ministerial under binding Council oversight with no independent scheduling or fee discretion, so no Arkanian authority over transit is established (objective 1).", "A standing multilateral institutional role gives Belvar a durable foothold that outlasts the crisis and the turn-4 mandate lapse (objective 2).", "The security role is defined, time-bound and no-footprint, avoiding an open-ended deployment (objective 3).", "The insurance underwrite proceeds independently as the durable-role path consistent with Cestia's no-foreign-soldiers red line."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 3}
