2026-09-28 12:39:56,777 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:39:56.310422", "id": "a601cff3-43d3-49c7-9d05-92f32b948ed7", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Cestia confirms its endorsement of the Northern Strait Transit Authority on the final charter text we have jointly verified with Arkania and Belvar. Our three conditions stand and are codified in that text: genuinely multilateral Council governance with a purely ministerial, Council-answerable secretariat; binding toll-free passage for Cestian-flagged grain shipping; and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil. We are ready to close the Authority together this week and to see it implemented as written. Cestia will not accept any arrangement that leaves transit under single-power control or places foreign soldiers on our soil.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 12:39:56,778 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "Cestia formally confirms its endorsement of the Northern Strait Transit Authority on the verified final charter text and calls for its immediate establishment and implementation this week, with the secretariat remaining purely ministerial under binding Council oversight, binding toll-free passage for Cestian-flagged grain shipping, and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil.", "actor_id": "cestia", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "The Northern Strait Transit Authority is established and takes effect as a genuinely multilateral body that secures toll-free passage for Cestian-flagged shipping and keeps Cestian soil free of any foreign military footprint, resolving the Strait's governance before Belvar's mandate lapses.", "id": "f2d62032-c96d-4780-b76f-5b3e02a2687e", "pros": ["Both Arkania and Belvar have endorsed the identical final charter text that codifies all three of Cestia's conditions, so the Authority can close now.", "The equal-voice Council with a purely ministerial, council-answerable secretariat prevents any single power from controlling transit scheduling.", "The binding toll-free guarantee for Cestian-flagged grain secures Cestia's economic lifeline through the Strait.", "The defined time-bound no-footprint security role keeps foreign soldiers off Cestian soil, preserving the coalition government.", "Establishing the Authority now resolves the standoff before Belvar's turn-4 mandate lapse, avoiding a governance vacuum that would reopen the contest."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 3}
