2026-09-28 12:47:03,179 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:46:21.705977", "id": "9c1ea156-4f8a-44f6-a53e-ea294b73c8cc", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Belvar confirms the Northern Strait Transit Authority is now in effect and durable: equal-voice Council governance, a purely ministerial secretariat under binding Council oversight, toll-free passage for Cestian-flagged grain, and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil. With the Authority established as our durable institutional foothold, Belvar's defined, time-bound security role concludes as planned and our task group stands down as the mandate lapses - no open-ended deployment. Our insurance underwrite for Cestia's grain route proceeds on terms independent of any military footprint.", "turn": 4, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 12:47:03,180 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:46:22.332960", "id": "74701819-3e5c-4e29-836e-a7b61b1ddf24", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Cestia - the Authority is now in force and durable, giving both of us a lasting, genuinely multilateral stake in the Strait without any foreign soldier on your soil. Our insurance underwrite for your grain route proceeds on terms independent of any military footprint, as agreed. We will not press for any basing or port access, and our task group stands down as the mandate lapses. We will hold Arkania to the ministerial codification under binding Council oversight.", "turn": 4, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:47:03,180 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:46:22.352410", "id": "deb673ed-737b-4716-bb3d-bb00287b7ae8", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Arkania - we welcome the Authority taking effect and will hold you to the ministerial codification in practice: the secretariat executes only Council-set rules under binding oversight, with no independent scheduling or fee discretion. Our defined, time-bound security role concludes as planned and our task group stands down with the mandate lapse. We look forward to the Authority operating as written, with the toll-free Cestian guarantee in force.", "turn": 4, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:47:03,180 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:47:02.363345", "id": "9c9221e1-6e2f-4fb6-b445-12f545ead6ea", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Arkania, Cestia remains ready to close the genuinely multilateral Authority we all reviewed, but the Strait's governance cannot stay unresolved while our grain trade hangs on it. We ask you directly for a firm, binding assurance that Cestian-flagged grain shipping is toll-free and non-discriminatory through the Strait, and that the Strait remains open to our commerce, whatever the Authority's fate. This stabilizes our economy and keeps Cestia neutral; it is not a step toward Belvar. We will not accept foreign soldiers on our soil under any arrangement.", "turn": 4, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:47:03,180 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:47:02.405988", "id": "dedaf80d-6a44-4aa6-9da4-fef8b055b55f", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Belvar, we accept your insurance underwrite for our grain route on the terms you offered, independent of any military presence. We note the Authority remains unestablished because Arkania still insists on unilateral control. Cestia will not accept any foreign military footprint on our soil, and we ask you to keep the Strait open without seeking basing or standing access. We will continue to press for genuinely multilateral governance.", "turn": 4, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:47:03,181 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:47:02.436834", "id": "470617a8-00a6-447d-9922-0cbaa0dd4f36", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Cestia reaffirms its standing position: no foreign soldiers on our soil; toll-free, non-discriminatory passage for Cestian-flagged shipping; and a Strait that remains open and governed by the consent of the states that depend on it. We remain ready to close a genuinely multilateral Authority and will not accept single-power control of the Strait.", "turn": 4, "visibility": "public"}
