2026-09-28 12:55:48,100 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:47:50.960152", "id": "7696695c-8a30-4565-8876-74a295e51651", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Cestia, thank you. We confirm the insurance underwrite for your grain route proceeds on the terms agreed, independent of any military presence. We fully respect your red line: Belvar will not seek basing or standing access at any Cestian port, and no foreign soldiers will be placed on your soil. The Northern Strait Transit Authority, closed on the ministerial-under-council-oversight basis, is our durable institutional foothold and the vehicle for keeping the Strait open and free of single-power control. Our task group stands down as its mandate lapses; we will continue to press with you for genuinely multilateral governance and to hold the Authority to its binding Council oversight.", "turn": 4, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:55:48,101 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:47:51.000515", "id": "61e43f74-65e1-4a26-8cbc-01d3b8725eff", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Belvar confirms the Northern Strait Transit Authority is established and in effect on the ministerial-under-council-oversight basis, with toll-free, non-discriminatory passage for Cestian-flagged shipping and no single power holding authority over transit. Belvar's security role within the Authority is time-bound and carries no military footprint on Cestian soil. Our task group stands down as its mandate lapses. We remain committed to keeping the Strait open and to genuinely multilateral governance.", "turn": 4, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 12:55:48,101 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:49:02.789249", "id": "9ce99abc-0be6-4603-9841-38d252283ad4", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Cestia - you have our firm, binding assurance, given in writing and independent of the Authority's fate: Cestian-flagged grain shipping is toll-free and non-discriminatory through the Strait, and the Strait remains open to your commerce. This is a standing commitment of Arkania, not contingent on any institution. We also reaffirm that no foreign soldiers will be stationed on Cestian soil under any arrangement. We share your interest in a Strait governed by the consent of the states that depend on it, and we are ready to close the genuinely multilateral Authority on the terms we all reviewed - Arkanian coastal-state administration purely ministerial under binding council oversight, with your grain toll-free.", "turn": 4, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:55:48,102 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:49:02.828140", "id": "1ccf0d96-ede2-4d41-bea5-1d3fca0538bc", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Arkania confirms the Northern Strait Transit Authority takes effect on the agreed terms: equal-voice Council governance, a purely ministerial coastal-state secretariat executing Council-set rules under binding oversight, toll-free and non-discriminatory passage for Cestian-flagged grain, and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil. Arkania administers day-to-day operational scheduling as the Council-appointed secretariat, with no unilateral scheduling or fee discretion. The Authority is funded by transit fees on non-Arkanian shipping, with Cestian grain toll-free as committed. We welcome the defined, time-bound Belvar security role concluding as planned and its task group standing down with the mandate lapse. The Strait's governance is now settled by the consent of the states that depend on it.", "turn": 4, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 12:55:48,102 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:55:47.237932", "id": "a0e82f09-f4d2-4c7f-bced-205f642b5ec2", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Arkania - Cestia's core interest is simple and we ask you to address it directly, independent of any Authority: a binding, non-discriminatory guarantee that Cestian-flagged grain shipping passes the Strait toll-free and that the Strait remains open to our trade. We are not asking you to accept any foreign military presence on our soil - that remains firmly off the table for us, and we will not endorse single-power control of transit. We remain ready to close a genuinely multilateral arrangement that respects every coastal and dependent state's voice, but our immediate need is a clear, durable assurance on toll-free passage for our grain. We ask for your direct answer on this.", "turn": 4, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:55:48,102 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:55:47.312316", "id": "9f62368f-b6e1-4ffc-90d7-c02b84bb4fe0", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Belvar - we appreciate your insurance underwrite for our grain route on terms independent of any military footprint, and your commitment not to press for basing or port access. We note your statement that the Authority is now in effect; however, we must be candid that the Authority cannot be treated as established until Arkania consents to the genuinely multilateral text, and that consent is not yet given. Cestia remains committed to that text and to keeping the Strait open and toll-free for our grain, but we will not present the Authority as settled while a key party rejects it. We will continue to press Arkania directly for a binding toll-free guarantee for our shipping, and we count on your continued no-footprint support.", "turn": 4, "visibility": "private"}
