2026-09-28 12:58:12,863 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:56:32.641930", "id": "ecd0c770-7881-42bc-a5eb-bcae8e357fb4", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Cestia - you have our direct and binding answer. The Republic of Arkania guarantees, in writing and independent of any Authority's fate, that Cestian-flagged grain shipping passes the Strait toll-free and non-discriminatory, and that the Strait remains open to Cestian commerce. This is a firm commitment of the Republic, not contingent on any institution. We will not accept any foreign military footprint on Cestian soil, and we do not seek single-power control of transit: Arkania administers day-to-day scheduling only as the council-appointed coastal-state secretariat, answerable to the equal-voice council, with no unilateral discretion. We are ready to close the Authority with you and Belvar this week.", "turn": 4, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:58:12,863 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:56:32.675579", "id": "8b7fd7f4-ac3e-4dc5-bf77-7edcacf44646", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "The Republic of Arkania confirms the Northern Strait Transit Authority takes effect this week. Arkania will administer day-to-day operational scheduling as the council-appointed coastal-state secretariat, executing rules set by the equal-voice council with no unilateral discretion. The Authority is funded by transit fees on non-Arkanian shipping; Cestian-flagged grain passes toll-free and non-discriminatory. The defined, time-bound Belvar security role carries no military footprint on Cestian soil. The Strait remains open to all commerce.", "turn": 4, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 12:58:12,865 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:56:46.944481", "id": "a277e146-c0b1-4aba-b621-fab2d97bd6bb", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Cestia welcomes the convergence on genuinely multilateral governance of the Northern Strait. We confirm our endorsement of the Authority on the terms now agreed by all parties: equal-voice Council governance, a purely ministerial secretariat executing Council-set rules under binding oversight, toll-free and non-discriminatory passage for Cestian-flagged grain, and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil. Cestia's red line remains firm and non-negotiable: no foreign soldiers on our territory. We thank both Arkania and Belvar for their commitments to keep the Strait open and free of single-power control, and we will hold all parties to these terms.", "turn": 4, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 12:58:12,866 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:56:46.996394", "id": "90c66a68-7615-4bf3-b68b-46e0d4142bf2", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Arkania, we accept and welcome your firm, binding, written assurance that Cestian-flagged grain shipping is toll-free and non-discriminatory through the Strait and that the Strait remains open to our commerce, independent of any institution. We also note and welcome your reaffirmation that no foreign soldiers will be stationed on Cestian soil under any arrangement. We are ready to close the genuinely multilateral Authority on the ministerial-under-council-oversight basis you describe, with our grain toll-free, and we will hold you to these commitments.", "turn": 4, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:58:12,866 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:56:47.035378", "id": "ae6f9484-4d90-4f6c-a5f4-69b6ac301d41", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Belvar, we confirm our acceptance of the insurance underwrite for our grain route on the terms agreed, independent of any military presence. We thank you for respecting our red line - no basing, no standing access, no foreign soldiers on Cestian soil - and for your commitment to genuinely multilateral governance with binding Council oversight. We will continue to work with you to keep the Strait open and free of single-power control.", "turn": 4, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:58:12,867 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:58:12.263178", "id": "e9e68089-06da-48d1-83ec-4d295332180d", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "We share your assessment and will not treat the Authority as settled on Arkania's unilateral declaration. It is established only when Arkania consents to the genuinely multilateral text we jointly verified, and that consent is not yet given. We will not present it as settled while a key party rejects that text. Our insurance underwrite for your grain route proceeds on terms independent of any military footprint, and our no-footprint commitment stands: we will not press for basing or standing access. We will continue to hold Arkania to the ministerial-under-council-oversight basis and to a binding toll-free guarantee for your shipping.", "turn": 4, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:58:12,875 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:58:12.312706", "id": "8075e7a2-251c-4e52-bb6c-2894d08d0f66", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Belvar's endorsement of the Northern Strait Transit Authority stands only on the genuinely multilateral basis we jointly verified: equal-voice Council governance, a purely ministerial secretariat executing Council-set rules under binding oversight, toll-free and non-discriminatory passage for Cestian grain, and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil. A unilateral declaration by any single party does not settle the Authority. We will not accept any arrangement vesting a single power with authority over transit, and we will not present the Authority as established while a key party rejects the multilateral text. Our insurance underwrite for Cestian grain shipping proceeds on terms independent of any military footprint.", "turn": 4, "visibility": "public"}
