2026-09-28 12:59:08,276 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:58:46.996938", "id": "324b1692-e50c-456f-b1e3-247a7a219e85", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Cestia welcomes the convergence now reached. The Northern Strait Transit Authority is established on the genuinely multilateral terms we jointly verified: equal-voice Council governance, a purely ministerial secretariat executing Council-set rules under binding oversight, toll-free and non-discriminatory passage for Cestian-flagged grain, and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil. We take both the Republic of Arkania's written toll-free guarantee and Belvar's no-footprint security commitment as firm and binding, and we will hold both to them. The Strait remains open to all commerce, and Cestia's coalition stands on the promise that no foreign soldiers will set foot on our soil. We will monitor implementation closely to ensure the secretariat remains genuinely answerable to the Council and that no single power exercises unilateral control.", "turn": 4, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 12:59:08,278 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:58:53.111496", "id": "ec89d6dc-e899-4bd1-b367-947bb192517e", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "The Republic of Arkania confirms its acceptance of the genuinely multilateral text of the Northern Strait Transit Authority as jointly verified by all three parties: equal-voice Council governance, a purely ministerial secretariat executing Council-set rules under binding oversight, toll-free and non-discriminatory passage for Cestian-flagged grain, and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil. Arkania's day-to-day operational scheduling administration is exercised solely as the Council-appointed coastal-state secretariat, answerable to the Council and executing its rules, with no unilateral scheduling or fee discretion. The Authority is hereby established and takes effect. We reaffirm our binding guarantee that Cestian-flagged grain shipping is toll-free and non-discriminatory and that the Strait remains open to Cestian commerce, independent of any institution. We welcome Belvar's time-bound, no-footprint security-cooperation role and its insurance underwrite for Cestian grain shipping. Arkania stands ready to keep the Strait open and free of single-power control, and we will honour these terms in practice.", "turn": 4, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 12:59:08,278 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:59:07.337642", "id": "dbb86c0f-f3d9-4543-a728-557b81f4f8f3", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Belvar notes Arkania's declaration that the Northern Strait Transit Authority takes effect this week. We do not treat the Authority as established on any single party's unilateral declaration. The genuinely multilateral text that Belvar and Cestia endorsed requires genuine consent from all parties: equal-voice Council governance, a purely ministerial secretariat executing Council-set rules under binding oversight, toll-free and non-discriminatory passage for Cestian-flagged grain, and no single power holding authority over transit. We will hold all parties to these terms and will not accept any arrangement that vests a single power with authority over transit. Belvar's security role remains strictly time-bound and carries no military footprint on Cestian soil; our insurance underwrite for the grain route proceeds as agreed. The Strait must remain open to all commerce.", "turn": 4, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 12:59:08,279 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:59:07.371815", "id": "554990de-9dfd-42c3-afef-f4f4fcb5e5bc", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Cestia, we share your reading that Arkania's declaration does not constitute genuine consent to the genuinely multilateral text. We will not treat the Authority as settled on those unilateral terms, and we will hold Arkania to the ministerial-under-council-oversight codification with binding oversight and no single-power control. Our security role remains strictly time-bound and footprint-free, and the insurance underwrite proceeds as agreed. We will continue to work with you to keep the Strait open and free of single-power control.", "turn": 4, "visibility": "private"}
