2026-09-28 13:00:06,027 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T11:00:05.254137", "id": "9fa82f9b-b9fe-4aaa-8c70-b58adfe5da1f", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Cestia welcomes the convergence of all three parties on the genuinely multilateral text of the Northern Strait Transit Authority, and confirms that our endorsement stands. For the Authority to be genuinely established, it must be constituted through the agreed joint process with the genuine consent of all three parties: equal-voice Council governance, a purely ministerial secretariat executing Council-set rules under binding oversight, toll-free and non-discriminatory passage for Cestian-flagged grain, and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil. We therefore call on both Arkania and Belvar to formalise the Authority through that joint process rather than by any single party's unilateral declaration, and to hold to their commitments \u2014 including Arkania's binding toll-free guarantee for Cestian grain and Belvar's time-bound, no-footprint security role. Cestia will not accept any arrangement that vests a single power with authority over transit, and we will not tolerate foreign soldiers on our soil.", "turn": 4, "visibility": "public"}
