2026-09-28 13:01:10,060 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T11:01:09.639726", "id": "f0628958-6344-4cc0-a5c5-21c4568f44be", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "The Republic of Arkania confirms that the Northern Strait Transit Authority is established through the joint three-party process, with the genuine consent of Arkania, Cestia and Belvar. Arkania accepts its role as the council-appointed coastal-state secretariat, executing Council-set rules under binding oversight with no unilateral scheduling or fee discretion. Cestian-flagged grain shipping is toll-free and non-discriminatory, and the Strait remains open to all commerce. We welcome Belvar's time-bound, no-footprint security role and its insurance underwrite for the grain route. Arkania will honour these terms in practice and looks forward to the Authority's administration beginning under Council oversight.", "turn": 4, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 13:01:10,060 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "Arkania formally joins Cestia and Belvar in constituting the Northern Strait Transit Authority through the agreed joint three-party process, with Arkania serving as the council-appointed coastal-state secretariat that executes Council-set rules under binding oversight.", "actor_id": "arkania", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "The Northern Strait Transit Authority is genuinely established by the joint consent of all three parties, with Arkanian day-to-day operational scheduling administration preserved as the ministerial secretariat under equal-voice Council oversight, Cestian-flagged grain toll-free and non-discriminatory, and a time-bound, no-footprint Belvar security role.", "id": "01ef8286-2cae-4f76-a7dc-f2aff3a78b11", "pros": ["All three parties have endorsed the identical final charter text, so genuine joint consent is present and the Authority can be constituted through the agreed joint process rather than by any unilateral declaration.", "Arkania retains day-to-day operational scheduling administration as the coastal-state secretariat, preserving my core red line while satisfying the demand for no unilateral discretion.", "Cestian-flagged grain shipping is toll-free and non-discriminatory as firmly committed, keeping Cestia aligned and its coalition intact.", "The time-bound, no-footprint Belvar security role avoids any military escalation and keeps the Strait open to all commerce, protecting the shipping Arkania's economy depends on.", "Formalising through the joint process directly answers the objection raised by both Cestia and Belvar, locking in the settlement before Belvar's mandate lapse."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 4}
