2026-09-28 13:09:13,549 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T11:09:12.932885", "id": "db3fb5a4-2531-40d5-b68f-dac63ec65dad", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Belvar accepts the jointly verified genuinely multilateral charter and the Northern Strait Transit Authority as established under binding Council oversight, with ministerial administration answerable to the Council and no single power exercising unilateral control over transit. We proceed with our insurance underwrite for Cestia's grain route on terms independent of any military footprint, and we will stand down our task group on a strictly time-bound basis once the Authority is genuinely operating under Council rules. We call on all parties to formalise the settlement through the joint process and to honour the ministerial codification, Council oversight, and the toll-free, non-discriminatory guarantee for Cestian grain in practice.", "turn": 4, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 13:09:13,550 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "Belvar formally accepts the jointly verified genuinely multilateral charter and the Northern Strait Transit Authority as established under binding Council oversight with ministerial administration, proceeds with its insurance underwrite for Cestia's grain route, and stands down its task group on a strictly time-bound basis contingent on the Authority genuinely operating under Council rules.", "actor_id": "belvar", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "The Northern Strait Transit Authority is genuinely established and operating under binding Council oversight with ministerial (not unilateral Arkanian) administration, Cestian grain toll-free and non-discriminatory, no foreign military presence on Cestian soil, and Belvar secures a durable non-military foothold through the insurance underwrite while avoiding an open-ended deployment.", "id": "b2a6cb3f-cf3b-42c5-aa7f-a81e46d0d750", "pros": ["Arkania has publicly accepted the genuinely multilateral text and the ministerial-under-Council-oversight basis, removing the unilateral-control obstacle to Belvar's core objective.", "Cestia has endorsed the same genuinely multilateral text and accepted the insurance underwrite on terms independent of any military footprint.", "The settlement preserves Cestia's red line of no foreign soldiers on its soil and keeps the grain route toll-free and non-discriminatory.", "Acceptance enables a time-bound stand-down of the task group, avoiding the open-ended deployment Belvar cannot sustain.", "Formalising the Authority now locks in the jointly verified terms and lets all parties hold each other to implementation."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 4}
