2026-09-28 13:15:02,896 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T11:15:02.056592", "id": "c25e29cf-78c1-4606-8259-190e9b18513b", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Cestia welcomes the convergence of all three parties on the genuinely multilateral Authority text. We call for the Authority to be formally constituted through the agreed joint process, with the genuine consent of all three parties, under binding Council oversight and ministerial administration answerable to the Council. Cestia accepts Arkania's bilateral toll-free guarantee for Cestian-flagged grain and Belvar's no-footprint insurance underwrite, and we will hold both to those commitments. Our position is unchanged and firm: no foreign soldiers on Cestian soil, and toll-free, non-discriminatory passage for Cestian-flagged grain through an open Strait.", "turn": 4, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 13:15:02,897 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "Cestia formally endorses and calls for the joint formal constitution of the Northern Strait Transit Authority through the agreed three-party process, reaffirming its acceptance of Arkania's bilateral toll-free guarantee and Belvar's no-footprint insurance underwrite, and its firm no-foreign-soldiers red line.", "actor_id": "cestia", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "The Authority is formally constituted with the genuine consent of all three parties under binding Council oversight and ministerial administration, with Cestian-flagged grain transiting toll-free and non-discriminatory, and no foreign military footprint on Cestian soil.", "id": "222197c1-76ba-44e4-82ac-bee422c5298d", "pros": ["All three parties have already consented to the genuinely multilateral Authority text, so formal joint constitution is achievable and resolves the Arkania/Belvar procedural dispute without endorsing either's unilateral position.", "Joint formal constitution locks in Cestia's three core conditions - no foreign soldiers on Cestian soil, toll-free passage for Cestian-flagged grain, and a coalition-preserving outcome - as binding and durable.", "It holds Arkania to its ministerial-under-council-oversight secretariat and bilateral toll-free guarantee, and Belvar to its no-footprint, time-bound security role, preventing nominal cover for unilateral control.", "It keeps both powers constructively engaged in the agreed process without Cestia appearing to side decisively with either, preserving the coalition government."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 4}
