2026-09-28 13:18:03,212 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T11:17:31.840140", "id": "dc80903d-0d3c-45f0-8912-759e76c87d39", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "The Northern Strait Transit Authority is now in effect, constituted through the joint three-party process with the full consent of Arkania, Cestia and Belvar. Arkania assumes its role as the council-appointed coastal-state secretariat, administering day-to-day operational scheduling strictly under the binding oversight of the equal-voice Council and executing the rules the Council sets \u2014 with no unilateral scheduling or fee discretion. Cestian-flagged grain transits toll-free and non-discriminatory, and the Strait remains open to Cestian commerce. We welcome Belvar's time-bound, no-footprint security-cooperation role and its insurance underwrite of Cestia's grain route, and we will hold to the ministerial codification in practice. The settlement is closed and durable.", "turn": 5, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 13:18:03,213 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T11:18:02.589742", "id": "aef35e07-b153-4030-a3ff-a5f2ee25c9f9", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Belvar confirms the Northern Strait Transit Authority is established and operating under binding Council oversight with ministerial administration answerable to the Council, toll-free and non-discriminatory passage for Cestian-flagged grain, and no single power holding authority over transit. Our insurance underwrite for Cestia's grain route proceeds on terms independent of any military footprint, and our task group stands down on a strictly time-bound basis as the mandate lapses - no open-ended deployment. We will monitor implementation closely and hold all parties to the ministerial codification, Council oversight, and the toll-free guarantee in practice.", "turn": 5, "visibility": "public"}
