2026-09-28 13:20:05,367 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T11:20:04.552555", "id": "798f7c4d-4eec-46dd-bece-1d730584d482", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Arkania confirms the Northern Strait Transit Authority is in effect and operating. As the council-appointed coastal-state secretariat, we begin day-to-day operational scheduling administration, executing the rules set by the equal-voice Council under binding oversight \u2014 no unilateral scheduling or fee discretion. Cestian-flagged grain transits toll-free and non-discriminatory, as we have guaranteed in writing. We welcome Belvar's insurance underwrite for Cestia's grain route on terms independent of any military footprint and its task group standing down on a strictly time-bound basis. The three-party settlement is closed and durable; we will honour the ministerial codification and Council oversight in practice.", "turn": 5, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 13:20:05,369 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "Arkania formally confirms the Northern Strait Transit Authority is in effect and begins day-to-day operational scheduling administration as the council-appointed coastal-state secretariat, executing council-set rules under binding Council oversight, with Cestian-flagged grain toll-free and non-discriminatory and the time-bound, no-footprint Belvar security role standing down.", "actor_id": "arkania", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "The three-party settlement is locked in and durable: Arkanian authority over transit scheduling is established and funded through fees on non-Arkanian shipping, Cestian grain transits toll-free, and direct armed conflict with Belvar is avoided.", "id": "8d9b204c-c5c7-450a-abac-5693ffe3e168", "pros": ["All three parties have endorsed the final charter and the Authority is already established and operating, so confirming the closing reflects settled convergence rather than new demands.", "The ministerial/secretariat role preserves Arkanian day-to-day operational scheduling administration under council rules, satisfying the core objective without unilateral control that Belvar and Cestia would reject.", "Fees on non-Arkanian shipping fund the Authority while Cestian grain stays toll-free, honouring the binding written guarantee and keeping Cestia aligned.", "The time-bound, no-footprint Belvar role and task-group stand-down avoid the direct armed conflict Arkania depends on avoiding.", "Public confirmation of the closing deters any party from reopening terms and locks in the settlement before the mandate fully lapses."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 5}
