2026-09-28 13:26:52,057 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T11:26:51.117973", "id": "ddacc788-613c-438f-abc4-9bf0ae64f92b", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Cestia welcomes the convergence of all three parties on the genuinely multilateral Authority text and the commitments to Council oversight, the toll-free guarantee for Cestian-flagged grain, and a time-bound, no-footprint security role. To remove any remaining doubt, we call on both Arkania and Belvar to complete the formal joint constitution of the Authority through the agreed three-party process, with the genuine consent of all parties, and to codify the ministerial-under-Council-oversight secretariat so that no single power exercises unilateral scheduling or fee discretion. Cestia will hold both powers to these terms and to the standing guarantee that our grain transits toll-free and our soil remains free of foreign soldiers.", "turn": 5, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 13:26:52,057 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "Cestia formally calls for the Northern Strait Transit Authority to be constituted through the agreed joint three-party process with the genuine consent of all three parties, and for both powers to codify the ministerial-under-Council-oversight secretariat, the toll-free, non-discriminatory guarantee for Cestian-flagged grain, and the time-bound, no-footprint security role.", "actor_id": "cestia", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "The Northern Strait Transit Authority is formally and jointly constituted by all three parties under binding Council oversight, with no single power exercising unilateral scheduling or fee discretion, Cestian-flagged grain transiting toll-free and non-discriminatorily, and no foreign military footprint on Cestian soil.", "id": "6339c25b-a718-4760-8739-fb4fc7f53cf5", "pros": ["All three parties have already consented to the genuinely multilateral text, so joint formal constitution is achievable and removes the procedural dispute between Arkania and Belvar.", "Binding Council oversight and ministerial codification prevent the secretariat from becoming nominal cover for unilateral control.", "The toll-free, non-discriminatory guarantee protects Cestia's grain economy and the coalition's core promise.", "The time-bound, no-footprint security role keeps Cestian soil free of foreign soldiers, preserving the coalition government.", "Joint constitution with genuine consent keeps both powers engaged without Cestia siding with either."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 5}
