2026-09-28 13:28:59,233 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T11:28:28.805881", "id": "8e3b6df7-fb67-435e-847e-f3c5841534ff", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "The Republic of Arkania confirms that the joint three-party constitution of the Northern Strait Transit Authority is complete and in force. The Authority operates under binding Council oversight, with Arkania serving as the council-appointed coastal-state secretariat for day-to-day operational scheduling administration, executing the rules set by the equal-voice Council with no unilateral scheduling or fee discretion. Cestian-flagged grain transits toll-free and non-discriminatorily, and the defined, time-bound Belvar security-cooperation role proceeds with no military footprint on Cestian soil. Arkania will honour these terms in full and looks forward to the Authority's durable operation for the benefit of all who depend on the Strait.", "turn": 6, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 13:28:59,234 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T11:28:57.420200", "id": "f1bd96a7-f745-4dd3-8852-b21dd170194c", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Cestia's position is settled and unchanged. We reaffirm our support for the Northern Strait Transit Authority as a genuinely multilateral institution: equal-voice Council governance, a ministerial secretariat answerable to the Council, binding toll-free and non-discriminatory passage for Cestian-flagged grain, and a strictly time-bound, no-footprint security role. We call on both powers to complete the formal joint constitution of the Authority through the agreed three-party process, with the genuine consent of all three parties, so that no single power exercises unilateral scheduling or fee discretion. We hold Arkania to its written toll-free guarantee and to a secretariat genuinely answerable to the Council, and we hold Belvar to its no-footprint, time-bound stand-down. Cestian soil remains free of foreign soldiers. On these terms the Strait stays open and our coalition stands.", "turn": 6, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 13:28:59,234 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T11:28:57.499467", "id": "1735d799-e7f4-4b34-a0d2-b7b404cba9ad", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Belvar confirms the Northern Strait Transit Authority settlement as jointly constituted under binding Council oversight. We will continue to monitor implementation to ensure the secretariat remains answerable to the Council and that no single power exercises unilateral scheduling or fee discretion. Our insurance underwrite for Cestia's grain route proceeds on terms independent of any military footprint, and our task group stands down on the agreed time-bound basis. We hold all parties to the ministerial codification, the toll-free guarantee for Cestian-flagged grain, and the no-footprint security role.", "turn": 6, "visibility": "public"}
