2026-09-28 13:30:37,979 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T11:30:36.985529", "id": "9b106e08-e1ef-4647-b3ae-6e02f041bce7", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Arkania confirms the joint three-party constitution of the Northern Strait Transit Authority is complete and in force. As the council-appointed coastal-state secretariat, we begin day-to-day operational scheduling administration under binding Council oversight, executing the rules the Council sets. Cestian-flagged grain transits toll-free and non-discriminatory, and the Authority is funded through fees on non-Arkanian shipping. We hold to the time-bound, no-footprint security role and to a secretariat genuinely answerable to the Council. The Strait stays open, and the settlement stands.", "turn": 6, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 13:30:37,980 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "Arkania formally completes the joint three-party constitution of the Northern Strait Transit Authority and begins day-to-day operational scheduling administration as the council-appointed coastal-state secretariat, executing council-set rules under binding Council oversight.", "actor_id": "arkania", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "The Northern Strait Transit Authority is fully established and in force through the agreed three-party process, with Arkania administering day-to-day operational scheduling as the council-appointed coastal-state secretariat under binding Council oversight, funded through fees on non-Arkanian shipping, Cestian-flagged grain transiting toll-free and non-discriminatory, and a strictly time-bound, no-footprint Belvar security role.", "id": "43c0495f-c726-4108-b709-0022f06319a2", "pros": ["All three parties have formally endorsed the final charter text and both Cestia and Belvar have reaffirmed the settlement this turn, so the joint constitution is genuinely consensual and complete.", "The settlement preserves Arkania's red line: day-to-day operational scheduling administration remains in Arkanian hands as the coastal-state secretariat, answerable to the equal-voice Council.", "The Authority is funded through fees on non-Arkanian shipping while Cestian-flagged grain stays toll-free, satisfying Arkania's funding objective without alienating Cestia.", "The time-bound, no-footprint Belvar security role and insurance underwrite avoid any military escalation, protecting the shipping Arkania's economy depends on.", "Completing the closing now locks in the durable settlement and prevents any reopening that could push Cestia toward Belvar."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 6}
