2026-09-28 13:33:25,945 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T11:33:25.175154", "id": "aec9c4dc-1f53-44b6-97c9-9eee1f521e57", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Belvar confirms the Northern Strait Transit Authority settlement as genuinely multilateral and settled. We reaffirm our commitment to monitor implementation so the secretariat remains answerable to the Council and no single power exercises unilateral scheduling or fee discretion. Our insurance underwrite for Cestia's grain route proceeds as our durable non-military foothold, and our task group completes its time-bound stand-down. We hold all parties to the ministerial codification, binding Council oversight, and the toll-free, non-discriminatory guarantee for Cestian grain.", "turn": 6, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 13:33:25,946 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "Belvar formally confirms the Northern Strait Transit Authority settlement as genuinely multilateral and settled, reaffirms its standing commitment to monitor implementation so the secretariat remains answerable to the Council and no single power exercises unilateral scheduling or fee discretion, maintains its insurance underwrite for Cestia's grain route as its durable non-military foothold, and completes the time-bound stand-down of its task group.", "actor_id": "belvar", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "The genuinely multilateral Authority settlement is confirmed as settled and durable: no Arkanian unilateral authority over transit, Cestian-flagged grain transits toll-free and non-discriminatory, Belvar retains a standing non-military foothold through the insurance underwrite, and Belvar avoids an open-ended deployment while its monitoring role holds all parties to the ministerial codification and Council oversight.", "id": "e2f6ed49-357b-44f0-84e8-ab372c3312fb", "pros": ["All three parties have formally accepted the genuinely multilateral text and the Authority is established and operating under binding Council oversight with ministerial administration.", "Arkania's closing position matches the agreed settlement and does not exceed the ministerial-under-Council-oversight basis, so no Con is warranted.", "The insurance underwrite gives Belvar a durable non-military foothold at a Cestian port independent of any military footprint, satisfying the standing-access objective.", "The time-bound task-group stand-down avoids an open-ended deployment, satisfying the mandate constraint.", "Belvar's explicit monitoring commitment addresses the residual risk that Arkania might drift toward unilateral control in practice."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 6}
