2026-09-28 13:38:37,760 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T11:38:35.867116", "id": "460935fd-ce57-42be-94ce-95dfe4198115", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Cestia formally confirms the Northern Strait Transit Authority settlement as settled and durable. We hold both Arkania and Belvar to their written commitments: Cestian-flagged grain transits toll-free and non-discriminatory, the Strait stays open, the secretariat remains answerable to the Council with no single power exercising unilateral scheduling or fee discretion, and no foreign military footprint on Cestian soil. On these terms our coalition and our economy are secure, and we will hold both powers to them.", "turn": 6, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 13:38:37,761 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "Cestia formally confirms the Northern Strait Transit Authority settlement as settled and durable, and calls on both Arkania and Belvar to hold to their written commitments under the genuinely multilateral terms.", "actor_id": "cestia", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "The Authority settlement stands on the agreed genuinely multilateral terms: Cestian-flagged grain transits toll-free and non-discriminatory, no foreign military footprint on Cestian soil, the secretariat remains answerable to the Council with no single power exercising unilateral scheduling or fee discretion, and the coalition government is preserved.", "id": "93459794-b5cb-4987-95de-d6e7d1cf254c", "pros": ["All three parties have formally consented to the genuinely multilateral text and confirmed the joint three-party constitution is complete and in force, so the settlement is settled and durable.", "The settlement secures Cestia's core objectives: toll-free passage for Cestian-flagged grain (via both the Authority and Arkania's bilateral written guarantee) and no foreign soldiers on Cestian soil.", "Belvar's turn-6 commitment to monitor implementation ensures the secretariat stays answerable to the Council and no single power exercises unilateral control, guarding against backsliding.", "Cestia's endorsement of the settlement preserves the coalition government by avoiding any exclusive alignment with either power and any foreign military footprint.", "Confirming the settlement now locks in the favorable terms and avoids reopening a fragile negotiation that could jeopardize toll-free passage or invite a foreign presence."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 6}
